<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>My Study Subjects</title>

    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background: #eef4ff;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: auto;
            background: white;
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 15px;
        }

        h1 {
            text-align: center;
        }

        .subjects {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            gap: 15px;
        }

        .subject {
            padding: 20px;
            background: #f5f8ff;
            border-radius: 10px;
        }

        .subject h3 {
            margin-top: 0;
        }

        @media(max-width: 600px) {
            .subjects {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="container">

    <h1>📚 My Study Subjects</h1>

    <p>
        This page contains a list of my current study subjects and
        what I want to learn from each one.
    </p>

    <div class="subjects">

        <div class="subject">
            <h3>💻 Computer Science</h3>
            <p>Learning programming, computers and software concepts.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="subject">
            <h3>➗ Mathematics</h3>
            <p>Practicing formulas, calculations and problem solving.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="subject">
            <h3>🌐 Web Development</h3>
            <p>Learning HTML, CSS and basic website development.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="subject">
            <h3>🗄️ Database</h3>
            <p>Understanding databases, tables and SQL concepts.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="subject">
            <h3>🔢 Data Structures</h3>
            <p>Learning arrays, stacks, queues and linked lists.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="subject">
            <h3>🌱 Environmental Studies</h3>
            <p>Learning about nature, resources and environmental protection.</p>
        </div>

    </div>

</div>

</body>
</html>
